{"task_id": "HumanEval/6", "solution": "def parse_nested_parens(paren_string: str) -> List[int]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the deepest level of nesting for each group of parentheses in the input string.\n    Groups are separated by spaces.\n    \"\"\"\n    groups = paren_string.split(' ')\n    result = []\n\n    for group_str in groups:\n        current_depth = 0\n        max_depth = 0\n        for char in group_str:\n            if char == '(':\n                current_depth += 1\n                max_depth = max(max_depth, current_depth)\n            elif char == ')':\n                current_depth -= 1\n        result.append(max_depth)\n    \n    return result"}
