{"task_id": "HumanEval/36", "solution": "def fizz_buzz(n: int):\n    \"\"\"Return the number of times the digit 7 appears in integers less than n which are divisible by 11 or 13.\"\"\"\n    total_sevens = 0\n\n    def _count_digit_7(num: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Counts occurrences of digit 7 in a non-negative integer.\"\"\"\n        count = 0\n        if num == 0: # Check if the number itself is 0, otherwise the loop won't run.\n            return 0\n        \n        temp_num = num\n        while temp_num > 0:\n            if temp_num % 10 == 7:\n                count += 1\n            temp_num //= 10\n        return count\n\n    for i in range(n):\n        if i % 11 == 0 or i % 13 == 0:\n            total_sevens += _count_digit_7(i)\n\n    return total_sevens"}
