{"task_id": "HumanEval/62", "solution": "def derivative(xs: list):\n    \"\"\" xs represent coefficients of a polynomial.\n    xs[0] + xs[1] * x + xs[2] * x^2 + ....\n     Return derivative of this polynomial in the same form.\n    \"\"\"\n    # The derivative of c*x^n is c*n*x^(n-1).\n    # For a polynomial sum(coeff[i] * x^i), the derivative is sum(coeff[i] * i * x^(i-1)).\n    # The constant term (i=0) vanishes.\n    # We iterate from the second coefficient (index 1) which corresponds to x^1.\n    return [coeff * idx for idx, coeff in enumerate(xs[1:], start=1)]"}
