{"task_id": "HumanEval/91", "solution": "import re\n\ndef is_bored(S):\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts the number of sentences starting with \"I\" (a boredom).\n    Sentences are delimited by '.', '?' or '!'.\n    \"\"\"\n    boredom_count = 0\n    # Split the string by sentence delimiters.\n    sentences = re.split(r'[.?!]', S)\n\n    for sentence in sentences:\n        # Trim leading/trailing whitespace from each sentence fragment.\n        cleaned_sentence = sentence.strip()\n\n        # Check if the cleaned sentence is non-empty and starts exactly with the word \"I\".\n        if cleaned_sentence and (cleaned_sentence.startswith(\"I \") or cleaned_sentence == \"I\"):\n            boredom_count += 1\n            \n    return boredom_count"}
