{"task_id": "HumanEval/149", "solution": "def sorted_list_sum(lst):\n    \"\"\"Filters the list to keep only even-length strings, then sorts them by length and alphabetically.\"\"\"\n    \n    # Filter out strings with odd lengths\n    even_length_strings = [s for s in lst if len(s) % 2 == 0]\n    \n    # Sort the remaining strings based on length and then alphabetically\n    # The key (len(s), s) ensures sorting primarily by length, then by the string itself for ties.\n    sorted_result = sorted(even_length_strings, key=lambda s: (len(s), s))\n    \n    return sorted_result"}
